> SELECT title FROM books WHERE author = 'Octavia E. Butler'
title
--------------------
Kindred
Parable of the Sower

> SELECT title, year, copies FROM books WHERE year >= 1980 AND copies > 0
title                | year | copies
---------------------+------+-------
Kitchen              | 1988 | 1
Parable of the Sower | 1993 | 1
Beloved              | 1987 | 1

> SELECT title FROM books WHERE title LIKE '%the%'
title
--------------------
Parable of the Sower

> SELECT title FROM books WHERE isbn IS NOT NULL
title
-----------------
Things Fall Apart
Kindred

